CM_ BO_ 2365533427 "Proprietary PGN 65324. Byte0 bits 1-0 ChargeRequest, bits 3-2 HeatingPadStatus. Byte1 CycleCount. Byte2 bits 1-0 EthEnable. Byte3-4 Hall ADC raw (mV). Byte5-6 12V sense ADC pin (mV).";
CM_ SG_ 2365533427 CycleCount "Ah-based cycle count, 0 to 8.";
CM_ SG_ 2365533427 HeatingPadStatus "0 Off, 1 ON, 2 invalid (Fault_HeatPadInvalid), 3 adhesion (Fault_HeatRelayAdhseionFault). Adhesion overrides invalid. Faults stay latched for the power cycle.";
CM_ SG_ 2365533427 EthEnable "I2t Eth switch for HVESSD5 CCL/DCL. 0 Disable: I2t NORMAL, I1 Peak map. 1 Enable: I2t OVERLOAD, I0 Continuous map.";
CM_ SG_ 2365533427 HallAdcRaw "MCU PTA15 AIN_HALL1 ADC result in mV, before Hall gain and current offset. Same value as ADC_HALL01_DET.";
CM_ SG_ 2365533427 Adc12V "12V sense port ADC pin voltage in mV, before gain 7. PTC6 ADC1 ch4 while the analog mux is on 12V. Rail mV is about this value times 7.";
CM_ BO_ 2364577523 "Status data set 1 for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2633785075 "Historical data for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2566675955 "Configuration data for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).
Note that configuration data should not dynamically change during vehicle operation.";
CM_ BO_ 2364580083 "Data set 7 (electrical) for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2364577267 "Data set 6 (external or interface data) for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2364577011 "Data set 5 (electrical data) for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
