CM_ BO_ 2364575987 "Data set 1 (electrical data) for High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2566722889 "Parameters for the battery charger connected to the main battery.";
CM_ BO_ 2350642096 "Control commands to be sent to High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack).";
CM_ BO_ 2558587824 "Hybrid or EV System Control 1 (HSC1), PGN 32768. Sent to the hybrid or EV system. PDU1, priority 6, every 1 s and on change but no faster than 100 ms. Nominal frame is Hub SA 0xB0 to BMS DA 0xF3.";
CM_ SG_ 2558587824 StoredEnergyChargeDischargeRateReq "0.4 %/bit. FBh requests the default charge/discharge rate.";
CM_ SG_ 2558587824 StoredEnergySetPointRequest "0.4 %/bit of usable HVES capacity. FBh requests the default set point.";
CM_ SG_ 2558587824 HybridModeRequestedMaxSpeed "1 km/h per bit, 0 to 250. FBh means no limit is requested. FFh means the sender does not support this parameter.";
CM_ SG_ 2558587824 HybridModeRequestedDistance "0.03125 km/bit. FB00h means no requested distance. FFFFh means not supported; distance is unlimited or the manufacturer default.";
